Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> documento
Rule 1     documento -> documento elemento
Rule 2     documento -> elemento
Rule 3     elemento -> H1 TEXT
Rule 4     elemento -> H2 TEXT
Rule 5     elemento -> ITEM TEXT

Terminals, with rules where they appear

H1                   : 3
H2                   : 4
ITEM                 : 5
TEXT                 : 3 4 5
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

documento            : 1 0
elemento             : 1 2

Parsing method: LALR

state 0

    (0) S' -> . documento
    (1) documento -> . documento elemento
    (2) documento -> . elemento
    (3) elemento -> . H1 TEXT
    (4) elemento -> . H2 TEXT
    (5) elemento -> . ITEM TEXT

    H1              shift and go to state 3
    H2              shift and go to state 4
    ITEM            shift and go to state 5

    documento                      shift and go to state 1
    elemento                       shift and go to state 2

state 1

    (0) S' -> documento .
    (1) documento -> documento . elemento
    (3) elemento -> . H1 TEXT
    (4) elemento -> . H2 TEXT
    (5) elemento -> . ITEM TEXT

    H1              shift and go to state 3
    H2              shift and go to state 4
    ITEM            shift and go to state 5

    elemento                       shift and go to state 6

state 2

    (2) documento -> elemento .

    H1              reduce using rule 2 (documento -> elemento .)
    H2              reduce using rule 2 (documento -> elemento .)
    ITEM            reduce using rule 2 (documento -> elemento .)
    $end            reduce using rule 2 (documento -> elemento .)


state 3

    (3) elemento -> H1 . TEXT

    TEXT            shift and go to state 7


state 4

    (4) elemento -> H2 . TEXT

    TEXT            shift and go to state 8


state 5

    (5) elemento -> ITEM . TEXT

    TEXT            shift and go to state 9


state 6

    (1) documento -> documento elemento .

    H1              reduce using rule 1 (documento -> documento elemento .)
    H2              reduce using rule 1 (documento -> documento elemento .)
    ITEM            reduce using rule 1 (documento -> documento elemento .)
    $end            reduce using rule 1 (documento -> documento elemento .)


state 7

    (3) elemento -> H1 TEXT .

    H1              reduce using rule 3 (elemento -> H1 TEXT .)
    H2              reduce using rule 3 (elemento -> H1 TEXT .)
    ITEM            reduce using rule 3 (elemento -> H1 TEXT .)
    $end            reduce using rule 3 (elemento -> H1 TEXT .)


state 8

    (4) elemento -> H2 TEXT .

    H1              reduce using rule 4 (elemento -> H2 TEXT .)
    H2              reduce using rule 4 (elemento -> H2 TEXT .)
    ITEM            reduce using rule 4 (elemento -> H2 TEXT .)
    $end            reduce using rule 4 (elemento -> H2 TEXT .)


state 9

    (5) elemento -> ITEM TEXT .

    H1              reduce using rule 5 (elemento -> ITEM TEXT .)
    H2              reduce using rule 5 (elemento -> ITEM TEXT .)
    ITEM            reduce using rule 5 (elemento -> ITEM TEXT .)
    $end            reduce using rule 5 (elemento -> ITEM TEXT .)

